  "statuteText": "83-F:2 Tax Imposed. –\n\nFor taxable periods beginning April 1, 1999, a tax is imposed upon the value of utility property at the rate of $6.60 on each $1000 of such value, to be assessed annually as of April 1, and every year thereafter, and paid in accordance with this chapter."
